    <subfield code="a">Clark Library copy features a warm inscription (dated June 30, 1994) from Darboven on front cover in black ink, along with accompanying ALS (addressed to same Thomas) written in red ink on three numbered transparent leaves, which each feature a different image from her Kinder dieser Welt cycle.</subfield>
    <subfield code="5">CLART</subfield>
